    "body": "Raising this here for input from @dlech: Based on how this is being implemented it seems like `maxWriteWithoutResponseSize` is a property of the connection rather than the characteristic so do you think it makes more sense to add it to the `BluetoothRemoteGATTServer` object?",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
