    "body": "Fair point. I was looking at the macOS and Windows implementations where this property is attached to the device and GATT session respectively. The BlueZ implementation does indeed read the property from the characteristic. I just want to avoid firing one event for every characteristic if it's not strictly necessary. Seems like it is though.\r\n\r\nThanks for the quick input!",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
