    "updated_at": "2026-08-11T23:24:22Z",
    "body": "After confirming that every other platform Bluetooth API I can find makes this a device-level property as well as other cross-platform APIs like btleplug I'm tempted to ignore BlueZ, attach this property to the `BluetoothRemoteGATTServer` and return the MTU of a randomly selected characteristic on BlueZ-based platforms.\r\n\r\nLet me sleep on it.",
